        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛对手巴西拉什维利，是从资格赛打上来的。第一盘五比六，梅德韦杰夫发球，十五比四十，对手拿到两个盘点。第一个盘点，对手选择和他反手对拉，那正是梅德韦杰夫最拿手的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "411e0014721e36520b3efa8e6c3c6b898a2302294955a4a98465fe7cb496cf97",
      "words_sha256": "5ed9ecb3f1ad08ed269489c14a114ec441e1679ae9e3dc6004716febca6d33ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4e2043d8574e6e051f4bcfd8cc2a9476fd9df269f4166e283bd636534957a973",
      "request_id": "4e2043d8574e6e051f4bcfd8cc2a9476fd9df269f4166e283bd636534957a973",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3576abc1bbce05c4b79e163d729dcac0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "两个盘点都救了回来，抢七却以六比八丢掉首盘。第二盘他两次破发，六比一。决胜盘第三局再破发，十四个发球局，他一个没丢。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "466f534d5e8cb9c2d6bddee2ef3760052e2d7c2934c68e46f4e1ba1e0ac91b69",
      "words_sha256": "735eedb7ae4e4c758c037da5f26dca5f26528289f37864a9474fe00de23a3a92"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:506908cd798c312803731ec44951cb7763827300a044a9de1df97bdfa7f34bc1",
      "request_id": "506908cd798c312803731ec44951cb7763827300a044a9de1df97bdfa7f34bc1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1289b9e486cc05c97f10adfaba35a581",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二六赛季第四冠，生涯第二十五冠，也是他第一次成功卫冕。梅德韦杰夫的冠军里，你最难忘哪一座？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f1a7874855031d445183457cfdaa41fb7dc1c333533edf9afa21c83d75963a7c",
      "words_sha256": "21a93807aceb24c2e88b46f8b741a82669c8614021bfee657c8e7da8a4e0ec4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:54c850b08ab4bdc58c4e1814878ecbf3ddb37f3adbe22192465179fefbebd745",
      "request_id": "54c850b08ab4bdc58c4e1814878ecbf3ddb37f3adbe22192465179fefbebd745",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f310e898746a39ac52c7159b2d3339ba",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四分之一决赛对阿特曼。十个发球局，他没给对手一个破发点，六比四、六比四。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5dba3e720d6f21d69459175b0309dd62efe54841c2542a8d8443024069622948",
      "words_sha256": "434c2282aff726d92a720fe2f74a78c2afa698ec99203c7ee729fb9953b3d94a"
    },
    {
