        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛对布勃利克，第一盘二十一分钟，六比三，五个发球局全保。盘间，布勃利克退赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ac69b675f952282900125ea319a827057e807d74741628df993ff32cab9b1310",
